@startuml UML-BACKGROUND-JOB-STATE-MACHINE
title KnowledgeOS — Background Job State Machine
caption Architecture V3.0

skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> Created
Created --> Accepted : durable acceptance succeeds
Created --> Failed : acceptance rejected

Accepted --> Waiting : dependency or schedule pending
Accepted --> Scheduled : immediately eligible

Waiting --> Scheduled : conditions satisfied
Waiting --> Cancelled : cancellation resolved
Waiting --> Failed : permanent dependency failure

Scheduled --> Running : Attempt acquires ownership
Scheduled --> Cancelled : cancelled before dispatch

Running --> Completed : durable effects established
Running --> RetryPending : retryable Attempt failure
Running --> Suspended : checkpointed interruption
Running --> Cancelled : cancellation resolved
Running --> Failed : permanent failure
Running --> RecoveryRequired : unknown outcome / lease loss

RetryPending --> Scheduled : retry policy permits
RetryPending --> Failed : retry budget exhausted
RetryPending --> Cancelled : cancellation resolved

Suspended --> Scheduled : resume creates new Attempt
Suspended --> Cancelled : cancellation resolved
Suspended --> RecoveryRequired : checkpoint invalid

RecoveryRequired --> Scheduled : reconciliation permits retry
RecoveryRequired --> Completed : reconciliation confirms success
RecoveryRequired --> Failed : reconciliation confirms failure
RecoveryRequired --> Cancelled : explicit cancellation outcome

Completed --> [*]
Failed --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]

note right of Running
  Every execution or retry uses a distinct Attempt Identity.
end note

note right of RecoveryRequired
  Unknown outcomes are never treated as safe blind retry.
end note

footer KnowledgeOS Architecture | UML | Version 3.0
@enduml
